{"id":"30a92d1834738e4f","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-relative-total-index.md","title":"相对全函数指标集","display":"df-relative-total-index — 相对全函数指标集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-relative-total-index","aliases":["20-df-relative-total-index"],"display":"df-relative-total-index — 相对全函数指标集","chapter":"4","section":"4.4.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Relativized Post Theorem 4.4.2；§4.9","source_printed_pages":[92,102],"source_pdf_pages":[128,138],"depends_on":["[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-relative-total-index"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-relative-total-index</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-relative-total-index — 相对全函数指标集"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.4.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Relativized Post Theorem 4.4.2；§4.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92</span><span>102</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>128</span><span>138</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tot}^A\">\\(\\mathrm{Tot}^A\\)</span> 是本条 Assertion 将引入的相对全性指标集记号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative-total-index}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Tot}^A:=\\{e:\\forall x\\in\\omega\\ \\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative-total-index}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Tot}^A:=\\{e:\\forall x\\in\\omega\\ \\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>量化对象是程序索引，不是函数图或度。固定 oracle 后，该集合的成员关系是一个自然数谓词；把阶段停止关系展开即得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_2^A\">\\(\\Pi_2^A\\)</span> 上界。</p>\n<p>来源：Relativized Post Theorem 4.4.2；§4.9；印刷页 92, 102；PDF 第 128, 138 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tot}^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative-total-index}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Tot}^A:=\\{e:\\forall x\\in\\omega\\ \\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi_2^A","display":false}],"bytes":1182,"backlinks":[{"id":"3c8c6546a7f5a867","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-relative-total-index]]；see [[20-df-rel-arith]]；see [[20-thm-relative-smn]]；see [[20-thm-rel-post]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-232","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-relative-total-index]] — 章 4；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-232","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-relative-total-index]]"}],"outgoing":["140cce30ee9c16d1"]}